            <div xml:id="d194">

                <pb facs="0310" n="208" sameAs="frus:frus1933v03/pg208"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94 Commission/839: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Geneva (Gilbert) to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Geneva</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-02-24T18:00:00+01:00">February 24, 1933—6
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received February 24—3 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>59. Supplementing my 58, February 24, 5 p.m.</p>
                <p>1. The following addendum was also made to the draft report as follows:</p>
                <p>Part 4, section 3, pertinent portion of final paragraph now reads: <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“Who are signatories of or have acceded to the Pact of Paris or the
                            Nine-Power Treaty.”</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gilbert</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
